    "detailed_description": "Join the exciting adventure of a character who survived the zombie apocalypse with an action-packed game called &quot;Run For Exodus&quot;. In a radio broadcast, you learn about the existence of the Exodus, a salvation ship for survivors. Your character embarks on a journey full of dangers to reach the ship.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will need to use your skills to avoid zombie attacks, fight and survive. It will be important to overcome the obstacles you encounter during your journey, clear the areas full of zombies and keep in touch and keep up to date with the current situation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUsing the courage and skills of your character, you will overcome difficult challenges and struggle to achieve your goal.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Run For Exodus&quot; will take you to an immersive story and suspense-filled action. Move towards a new hope in this world full of struggle for survival. Fight against the zombie apocalypse to complete your journey and reach the salvation ship.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn addition, you can do shooting drills by choosing different modes in the game, fight zombies and enjoy the game mechanics.",
    "about_the_game": "Join the exciting adventure of a character who survived the zombie apocalypse with an action-packed game called &quot;Run For Exodus&quot;. In a radio broadcast, you learn about the existence of the Exodus, a salvation ship for survivors. Your character embarks on a journey full of dangers to reach the ship.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will need to use your skills to avoid zombie attacks, fight and survive. It will be important to overcome the obstacles you encounter during your journey, clear the areas full of zombies and keep in touch and keep up to date with the current situation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUsing the courage and skills of your character, you will overcome difficult challenges and struggle to achieve your goal.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Run For Exodus&quot; will take you to an immersive story and suspense-filled action. Move towards a new hope in this world full of struggle for survival. Fight against the zombie apocalypse to complete your journey and reach the salvation ship.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn addition, you can do shooting drills by choosing different modes in the game, fight zombies and enjoy the game mechanics.",
    "short_description": "You find yourself in a zombie apocalypse in our RUN FOR EXODUS game specially designed for VR. Alone, wield weapons with real-life moves and explore a post-apocalyptic world in virtual reality. Get rid of these dead with the quests.",
